Distribution Management System (DMS)
Product Vision

Build a modern Distribution Management System (DMS) for small and medium-sized FMCG distributors in Nepal.

The system should cover the complete order-to-cash workflow while remaining simple enough for businesses with:

1–20 sales representatives
1–5 warehouses
Small accounting teams
Multiple delivery vehicles
Nepal VAT and taxation compliance

The architecture should prioritize:

extensibility over hardcoding
configurable business rules
auditability
accounting correctness
offline-friendly field operations
modular domain-driven design
