Biggest recommendation

The part I'd change most is your dispatch section. Don't think of it as "vehicle tracking." Think of it as order fulfillment:

Orders → Allocation → Picking → Packing → Loading → Delivery → POD → Returns

That workflow is flexible enough to support a distributor with one van today and dozens of trucks later, without locking you into a rigid implementation. Most successful DMS products treat dispatch as the orchestration layer between sales, warehouse, and delivery—not just a list of vehicles.